<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.member.admits ~ an operator's leaf enters the carriage board

`lares nexus contract <operator-pubkey> [--sig <hex>]` admits a joining operator's per-Nexus leaf, signed by the founding-kahu quorum, and emits the carried admit bundle (`--contract` spells the token too; `--sync-url` names the board). Where the seats rest in two vaults, `--out <file>` writes a partial and the other vault's `--from <partial>` judges, cosigns and lands it. Fail closed: an unseated charter, a sub-quorum or an invalid seal refuses and writes nothing.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ admit

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`admit` params=`nym/<operator-pubkey> sig/<hex> ~ admit an operator`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ nym · sig · contract · sync-url · nexus · out · from

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nym` params=`takes/key seat/1 as/<operator-pubkey> ~ the operator's per-Nexus leaf`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sig` params=`takes/hex ~ the accepts-carriage token`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`contract` params=`takes/hex ~ the same token, the other spelling`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sync-url` params=`takes/url ~ the board the admit names`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the partial for the next vault`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from` params=`takes/host-path ~ judge and cosign a partial another vault wrote`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ the founding-kahu quorum signs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.member.admits nym/<operator-pubkey>]] ~ no operator key named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ admitted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`admitted` params=`exit/0 fields/[[action nym evidenceCid threshold signers bundle findings]] ~ the admit landed and its bundle rides the answer`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

